#. reviewed CrowdIn PCSX2 2026-09-20
msgid ""
"Enables accurate alpha testing, which some games require to render "
"correctly. This may require more draw calls and result in a speed penalty."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverar noggrant alfatest, vilket vissa spel behöver för korrekt "
"rendering. Det kan kräva fler ritningsanrop och försämra prestandan."

#. reviewed CrowdIn PCSX2 2026-09-20
msgid ""
"Enables AA1 (PS2 antialiasing), which some games require to render "
"correctly. This may result in a heavy performance penalty."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverar AA1 (PS2-kantutjämning), vilket vissa spel behöver för korrekt "
"rendering. Detta kan ge en stor prestandaförlust."

