"Attempts to reduce draw calls in games which do heavy context switching for "
"blending purposes."
msgstr ""
"Försöker minska ritningsanrop i spel som gör många kontextbyten för "
"blandning."

#. reviewed CrowdIn PCSX2 2026-09-20
