msgstr "Skriv om stora ST"

#. reviewed CrowdIn PCSX2 2026-09-20
msgid "Rewrite Large ST"
msgstr "Skriv om stora ST"

#. reviewed CrowdIn PCSX2 2026-09-20
msgid ""
"Rewrite large ST coordinates and clamp the values (mainly for Ridge Racer V "
